<title>USA: Witco Corp Q3 oper shr falls to $0.21.</title>
<headline>Witco Corp Q3 oper shr falls to $0.21.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.21		    $0.26</p>
<p> Oper net		   11,900		   15,000</p>
<p> Revs			562,049		  441,902</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   56,867		   56,861</p>
<p>			Nine months</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.98		    $1.03</p>
<p> Oper net		   56,000		   58,300</p>
<p> Revs		    1,722,932		1,449,085</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   56,919		   56,542</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1995 operating per share excludes non-recurring item of $0.08 per share. 1995 per share including non-recurring items and additional $0.08 per share for income from discontinued operations would have been $0.42.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
